PY  - 2025
AB  - Here, we report the genome sequence of Escherichia lytic phage vB_EcoP_ShWW44, a podovirus isolated from wastewater using bovine Escherichia coli as a host. The genome is 72,444 bp long and has 89 predicted coding sequences, including an alanine-tRNA gene. It belongs to the subfamily Enquatrovirinae, genus Gamaleyavirus. Copyright © 2025 Alexyuk et al.
