AB  - Here, we report the complete genome sequence of a rare pigment-producing strain of Acinetobacter johnsonii. The genome consists of a 3,360,823-bp circular chromosome (G+C content, 41.56%) and an 8,887-bp plasmid (G+C content, 33.71%). It possesses 3,038 coding gene sequences, 19 rRNA genes, 87 tRNA genes, and 4 noncoding RNA (ncRNA) genes. Copyright © 2022 Mu et al.
